  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      61.92,
      521.28,
      553.89,
      543.35
    ],
    "text": "1.These Rules may be cited as the Construction Industry Development (Registration of Quality Management Audi-tors) Rules of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      61.92,
      557.28,
      553.91,
      603.35
    ],
    "text": "2.Any person who wishes to undertake technical auditing of any identified construction work shall make an applica-tion to the Construction Industry Development Authority (hereinafter referred to as the \"Authority\") along with any particu-lars as may be required by the Construction Industry Development Authority to register such person as a Quality Manage-ment Auditor under this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      79.92,
      617.28,
      328.01,
      627.35
    ],
    "text": "3. The qualifications required of such persons are as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      91.92,
      641.28,
      460.84,
      651.35
    ],
    "text": "(a) Relevant professional qualifications to carry out technical auditing under the said Act ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      91.92,
      663.36,
      415.82,
      673.43
    ],
    "text": "(b) Not less than fifteen years of post -graduate experience in the relevant field;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      91.92,
      685.2,
      321.92,
      695.27
    ],
    "text": "(c) Registered as a Qualified Person under the said Act ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      91.92,
      707.28,
      540.0,
      717.35
    ],
    "text": "(d) A corporate member of the professional institute of the relevant discipline or registered under any board of",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      109.92,
      719.28,
      436.83,
      729.35
    ],
    "text": "registration relating to construction industry established by an Act of Parliament.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.48,
      46.56,
      561.9,
      69.11
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2018'04'053 APART I: SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 05.04.2018",
