  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      69.12,
      110.16,
      561.31,
      144.23
    ],
    "text": "4. Any person registered with the Authority as a Quality Management Auditor shall, upon payment of the applicableregistration fee as specified in the Schedule hereto, be assigned with a registration number and issued with a Certificate ofRegistration which shall be valid for a period as specified in such Certificate.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      69.12,
      158.16,
      560.98,
      192.23
    ],
    "text": "5. Every Quality Management Auditor registered with the Authority shall prior to the date of expiry of such registration,make an application to the Authority along with the renewal fee as specified in the Schedule hereto for the renewal of suchCerificate.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      87.12,
      206.16,
      230.39,
      216.23
    ],
    "text": "6. For the purpose of these Reules -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
